# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored — never commit real values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical origin
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Used for canonical URLs, Open Graph URLs, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
# No trailing slash. Falls back to http://localhost:3000 when unset, which is
# correct for local development and wrong for anything you deploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shadcnblocks registry (paid)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Read by the shadcn CLI through `components.json`. Needed only when running
# `npm run block:add` — the app never reads it at runtime.
SHADCNBLOCKS_API_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keystatic — GitHub mode
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT needed while `keystatic.config.ts` uses local storage, which is how the
# base ships. Required once a project switches to GitHub mode, which is the
# intended deployed editing workflow (briefs/06-keystatic.md §2).
#
# Setup: docs/workflows/verification.md is the wrong place for this — see
# docs/architecture/overview.md → "Content boundary" and the Keystatic GitHub
# App instructions at https://keystatic.com/docs/github-mode
#
# KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
# KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
# KEYSTATIC_SECRET=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_KEYSTATIC_GITHUB_APP_SLUG=
